    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EMITIME is a rhythm-based deck-building game - where music is your strategy!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMITIME combines rhythm, deck builder, and grid-based strategy to create something unique, and enjoyable! Perform attacks and move around the grid to the rhythm and activate your skill cards to defeat enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick new cards as you encounter enemies during the battles, and equip yourself with powerful skills to defeat them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.poster.avif?t=1754452691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.webm?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.mp4?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.poster.avif?t=1754452691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.webm?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.mp4?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.poster.avif?t=1754452691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.webm?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.mp4?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Future Plans</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMITIME will have a Roguelike Mode which allows you to replay the game more than one... if not many times! Expand your deck as you meet new enemies on the map! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will feature two different characters (and more to come...), each with different movesets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a story mode where you follow the background story of the characters which are from the past and future ... including the duo protagonists - Aldrich, a royal engineer from the past, and Albert a farmer / combatant from the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/fd53f214c540a0108fc2265b022dc558.avif?t=1754452691\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EMITIME is a rhythm-based deck-building game - where music is your strategy!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMITIME combines rhythm, deck builder, and grid-based strategy to create something unique, and enjoyable! Perform attacks and move around the grid to the rhythm and activate your skill cards to defeat enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick new cards as you encounter enemies during the battles, and equip yourself with powerful skills to defeat them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.poster.avif?t=1754452691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.webm?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/8a095a83abf8a46bd06916d597bf86db.mp4?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.poster.avif?t=1754452691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.webm?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/86436210a4d5332e7bf64311ea3b1905.mp4?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.poster.avif?t=1754452691\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.webm?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/cc56c2231fde11aa48194a50b501e5db.mp4?t=1754452691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Future Plans</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMITIME will have a Roguelike Mode which allows you to replay the game more than one... if not many times! Expand your deck as you meet new enemies on the map! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game will feature two different characters (and more to come...), each with different movesets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will be a story mode where you follow the background story of the characters which are from the past and future ... including the duo protagonists - Aldrich, a royal engineer from the past, and Albert a farmer / combatant from the future!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2921640/extras/fd53f214c540a0108fc2265b022dc558.avif?t=1754452691\" width=400 height=160 /></span></p>",
